{"unit_id":"studyzy__dsh-web-remote-access#card-zh","repo":"studyzy/dsh-web-remote-access","commit":"1317af145f90ad9e0bc3f175fd1151dc33e44717","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@studyzy/dsh-web-remote-access 是面向 DSH Web profile 的远程访问 bundle 插件。它替换 Web 启动行，将 0.0.0.0 解析成本机具体 IPv4 网卡地址，并输出实际绑定地址及 harness 启动令牌 URL。远程 HTTP 页面还会注入 crypto.randomUUID polyfill，补足客户端所需能力。适合希望从局域网浏览器访问 DSH Web UI 的用户；通过 --host 指定绑定地址，访问凭据沿用 harness 会话令牌。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:38-57","src/startup.ts:8-14","src/url.ts:56-66","src/polyfill.ts:58-63"]}
